  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO Health adviser Tajik - WHO Health Tadjikistan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WHO H&#xe4;lsor&#xe5;dgivare Tajik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiering av r&#xe5;dgivare genom WHO till h&#xe4;lsoministeriet i  Tadzjikistan.R&#xe5;dgivaren skall leda uppbyggnaden av ministeriets h&#xe4;lsopolicy-funktion. St&#xf6;det str&#xe4;cker sig &#xf6;ver &#xe5;ren 2007-2010.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding of a Long Term Health Policy Advisor to the Ministry of health in Tajikistan through WHO. The advisor is placed within the MoH with the task of buildning up the ministry&apos;s capacity and function in health policy analysis. The support covers 2007-2010.</narrative>
  </description>
